'''Scratch''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The knife is pitch black in color with a navy blue guard and four blue scratches on the blade, hence its name.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Scratch (2016)|red reskin]] under the same name from the [[Halloween Event 2016|2016 Halloween Event]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Scratch_Set Scratch Set].

